                    <h2>Mobile Development</h2>
                    <p class="lead"> We build high-quality mobile applications designed for speed, performance, and exceptional user experience. From UI frameworks to backend APIs, we create mobile solutions that are reliable, scalable, and crafted to help your business grow in a mobile-first digital world.</p>

                    <div class="service-image" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
                        <img src="@Url.Content("~/images/mobile.jpg")" alt="Digital Marketing" class="img-fluid rounded">
                    </div>

                    <p>Our mobile development process blends clean coding, modern technologies, and user-centered design. We deliver apps that load fast, run smoothly, and provide seamless interaction across both Android and iOS devices.</p>

                    <!-- Service Features -->
                    <div class="service-features" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300">
                        <h4>What's Included</h4>
                        <div class="row gy-3">
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <div class="feature-item">
                                    <i class="bi bi-graph-up-arrow flex-shrink-0"></i>
                                    <div>
                                        <h5>Strategy Development</h5>
                                        <p>Defining app objectives, features, and a clear development roadmap.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <div class="feature-item">
                                    <i class="bi bi-bullseye flex-shrink-0"></i>
                                    <div>
                                        <h5>Implementation</h5>
                                        <p>Coding, integrating APIs, and building the core mobile experience.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <div class="feature-item">
                                    <i class="bi bi-palette flex-shrink-0"></i>
                                    <div>
                                        <h5>Optimization</h5>
                                        <p>Improving performance, fixing bugs, and enhancing user flow.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <div class="feature-item">
                                    <i class="bi bi-share flex-shrink-0"></i>
                                    <div>
                                        <h5>Results & Reporting</h5>
                                        <p>Final testing, analytics insights, and deployment to Play Store & App Store.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Process Steps -->
                    <div class="service-process" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="400">
                        <h4>Our Process</h4>
                        <div class="process-steps">
                            <div class="step-item">
                                <div class="step-number">01</div>
                                <div class="step-content">
                                    <h5>Strategy Development</h5>
                                    <p>Understanding user needs and shaping a feature-rich app blueprint.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="step-item">
                                <div class="step-number">02</div>
                                <div class="step-content">
                                    <h5>Implementation</h5>
                                    <p>
                                        Transforming ideas into a smooth, responsive, and powerful mobile app.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="step-item">
                                <div class="step-number">03</div>
                                <div class="step-content">
                                    <h5>Optimization</h5>
                                    <p>Fine-tuning speed, security, and overall app experience.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="step-item">
                                <div class="step-number">04</div>
                                <div class="step-content">
                                    <h5>Results Reporting</h5>
                                    <p>Delivering launch-ready builds, performance reports, and future growth insights.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
